# src/apps/daemon/internal/protocols/tlsfragment

## Purpose
uTLS/TLS fragmentation primitive used by diagnostics/runtime evasion.

## Architectural role
- Daemon dependency band: `protocols` (rank 1; lower rank = deeper implementation).
- Cross-band imports may point only to a lower rank. Same-band imports are allowed when they remain within one architectural layer.

## Contents
- Direct files (5): `sni_range.go`, `sni_range_test.go`, `utls_fragment.go`, `utls_fragment_compat_test.go`, `utls_fragment_test.go`

## Interfaces and dependencies
- Go package: `tlsfragment`.
- Notable exported surface: `FragmentationStrategy`, `SNIHostRange`, `UTLSFragmentConfig`, `WrapUTLSFragmentConn`.
- Daemon-local dependencies: none.
- Direct daemon callers: `internal/adapters/mobilebind`, `internal/analysis/diagnostics`, `internal/runtime/proxy`.

## Invariants
- `protocols` code must not import a higher-rank daemon band.

